                "value": "",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "就是，那些商店里的衣服我怎么挑，\n怎么都感觉不对——\n没有那种，自然风霜洗礼的沧桑、粗粝感。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010133017_1698119842_content",
                "value": "就是，那些商店里的衣服我怎么挑，\n怎么都感觉不对——\n没有那种，自然风霜洗礼的沧桑、粗粝感。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1698119842
            },
            {
